# Phase 79-mushaf: raw MushafDatabase Ligature-Based SVG source set (~760 MB,
# license "Sadaqa-e-Jaria"). Build-time input for tool/extract_mushaf_svg.py
# only — the committed artefact is assets/mushaf/mushaf_layout.json.gz. Keep a
# local copy to regenerate; never commit the raw SVGs.
/MushafDatabase-Ligature-Based-SVG-main_2/
/svg/
/svg2/
/quran-svg-main_3.zip

# Stray local files at repo root — not part of the app source.
/*.xlsx
/22780766_6685158.svg

# Quranpedia.net data dumps (raw, ~1.15 GB) — build-time input only, per
# docs/quran/QURAN_CORPUS_INTEGRATION.md. The committed artefacts are the
# curated bundled subset under assets/quran/ + the Supabase mirror. NEVER
# commit the raw dumps (licence: keep current via /v1/changes; huge).
/*.zip
/*.json.gz
/mushafs-*.json.gz
